{"supplier":"hotelbeds","supplierHotelId":"357348","name":"Mc Queen","description":"Located in the commercial centre of Athens, Mc Queen is less than a 7-minute walk from Keramikos Metro Station and the lively Gazi area. WiFi is offered throughout. The air-conditioned apartments at Mc Queen Rooms & Apartments are minimally decorated. Each includes a kitchenette with kettle, fridge and microwave and comes equipped with a satellite LCD TV, safe and hairdryer. Guests can start their day with a continental breakfast served daily 08:00-11:00 at the garden or in the apartment. VIP Transportation from Athens International Airport, as well as excursions in famous landmarks outside Athens can be arranged on request and upon charge. The Reception Hours : 07:30 - 15:30. Please contact us to receive the Entry Code for the Entrace and collect an envelope with your room key. You can proceed with the Check in Procedure the next day.","address":"Kastorias 24, 24","city":"ATHENS","countryCode":"GR","postalCode":"10447","lat":37.9841779644387,"lng":23.7113240431063,"giataCode":"424750","phone":"+302130099099","email":"info@mcqueenhotel.com","website":"www.mcqueenhotel.com","images":[{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/35/357348/357348a_hb_a_007.jpg","category":"exterior","order":0},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/35/357348/357348a_hb_a_008.jpg","category":"exterior","order":1},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/35/357348/357348a_hb_a_004.jpg","category":"exterior","order":2},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/35/357348/357348a_hb_a_009.jpg","category":"exterior","order":3},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/35/357348/357348a_hb_a_010.jpg","category":"exterior","order":4},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/35/357348/357348a_hb_a_011.jpg","category":"exterior","order":5},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/35/357348/357348a_hb_l_009.jpg","category":"lobby","order":6},{"url":"https: